      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "On every mini",
      "items": [
        "Ubuntu 24.04 LTS, OpenSSH with key auth from air-1, Node via nvm, then the Claude Code CLI",
        "One agent session per host, and a fixed address gw-1 hands back after every reinstall"
      ]
