    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Watching the room",
      "items": [
        "The cameras have no Ethernet port, so they join gw-1 over Wi-Fi and take no switch port",
        "A mini records only when something happens — nothing is written while the room is still"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Published with care",
      "items": [
        "Hosts appear under logical names only — no address, hostname or key material",
        "The switch is named because it has no address, no admin page and no firmware; the router and the cameras are not"
      ]
    }
